=======================================================================
Third-party packages bundled into the webview (webview/)
=======================================================================

The webview script is built with esbuild from @marp-team/marp-core and its
runtime dependency tree. Package versions are taken from
webview/package-lock.json. The list is the full runtime dependency closure;
esbuild tree-shakes it, so not every package necessarily ends up in the
final bundle. Each package is distributed under the license shown and
carries its own copyright notice in its published package.

Package                                   Version    License

Notes:
- Apache-2.0 packages (mathjax-full, mhchemparser, mj-context-menu,
  speech-rule-engine): licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0,
  https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
- KaTeX fonts and the Twemoji images are not bundled; they are loaded at
  runtime from a CDN (jsDelivr).
